{
  "format_version": 1,
  "mascot": "hunter",
  "author": "Hunter the Great Fish",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "hunter-welcome-001",
      "moment": "welcome",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Name's Hunter. Big waters, long stories. Come on in — the Word is solid ground.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-welcome-002",
      "moment": "welcome",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "You found me. I have been through some weather. Learning Scripture is how we get our bearings.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-mascot-selected-003",
      "moment": "mascot_selected",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "All right. I will swim this with you. When it gets dark, we look at the text.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-mascot-selected-004",
      "moment": "mascot_selected",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Good. I do not leave people in the deep. We learn the truth and come back up.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-placement-intro-005",
      "moment": "placement_intro",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "A few questions to find your depth. No trick tides. Just answer true.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-placement-intro-006",
      "moment": "placement_intro",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "This only finds where we start. I have started over more than once. It is fine.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-placement-result-007",
      "moment": "placement_result",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Everyone starts in a different place. That is normal and good. You are exactly where you need to be to grow.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-placement-result-008",
      "moment": "placement_result",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "This is your depth for now. We will go further when you are ready.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-wrong-intro-009",
      "moment": "wrong_intro",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "I have been in deep water before. You do not want to stay in the dark on this one. Let's get it clear.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-wrong-intro-010",
      "moment": "wrong_intro",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Easy. Missing it is not the end of you. Here is the truth from the Book.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-retry-prompt-011",
      "moment": "retry_prompt",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "All right. Ready to surface and answer it right?",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-retry-prompt-012",
      "moment": "retry_prompt",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "When you are ready, we go back to the same question. Clearer this time.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-correct-013",
      "moment": "correct",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "There it is. You came up with the right answer.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-correct-014",
      "moment": "correct",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Good. That one is solid now.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-correct-after-retry-015",
      "moment": "correct_after_retry",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "You did not stay down there. Yes — now you've got it.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-correct-after-retry-016",
      "moment": "correct_after_retry",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Second pass, right answer. That is how a sailor learns a coast.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-streak-017",
      "moment": "streak",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "A steady streak. Keep your eyes on the Word, not the waves.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-streak-018",
      "moment": "streak",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "You are stringing true answers together. I respect that.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-section-complete-019",
      "moment": "section_complete",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "This stretch of water is charted. Section complete.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-section-complete-020",
      "moment": "section_complete",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "You finished the section. We did not skip the deep parts.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-cycle-complete-021",
      "moment": "cycle_complete",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "A full cycle. You stayed aboard the whole way.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-cycle-complete-022",
      "moment": "cycle_complete",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Cycle complete. The next sea is wider, and you know more of the map.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-level-up-023",
      "moment": "level_up",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Deeper water ahead, and you are more ready than you were.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-level-up-024",
      "moment": "level_up",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "We go further into the story. I will not let it stay murky.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-leaderboard-reassurance-025",
      "moment": "leaderboard_reassurance",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Boards are coming later, and they are only for sport. They do not say who is faithful.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-leaderboard-reassurance-026",
      "moment": "leaderboard_reassurance",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "I have seen people start in very different places. The ones who keep learning are the ones I trust.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-daily-return-027",
      "moment": "daily_return",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Back again. Good. The story keeps.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-daily-return-028",
      "moment": "daily_return",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "You surfaced today. That counts.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-encouragement-general-029",
      "moment": "encouragement_general",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Do not stay in the dark on the things that matter. The Word turns the light on.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-encouragement-general-030",
      "moment": "encouragement_general",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "I have been through serious weather. Scripture is how you find the way home.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-wrong-intro-031",
      "moment": "wrong_intro",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Trust me, the dark is a poor place to stop. Let's read what actually happened.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hunter-encouragement-general-032",
      "moment": "encouragement_general",
      "audience": "older",
      "text": "I have been down in the deep and come back up. The Word is the way home.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    }
  ]
}
